description=Stock-aligned injection driver for POCO F6 (peridot) QCA6750 with STA helper vdev injection and monitor WEXT support (no crash, live packet injection, no channel -1). Compatible with KernelSU, SuKiSU Ultra, APatch, and Magisk.
